  "description": "Microsoft Testing is a set of platform, framework and protocol intended to make it possible to run any test on any target or device.\n\nThis package provides a Microsoft.Extensions.Logging bridge for the platform, allowing diagnostic log messages produced by Microsoft.Testing.Platform and its extensions to flow through any Microsoft.Extensions.Logging provider (Console, Debug, Serilog, OpenTelemetry, Application Insights, ...).",
